   "type": "research",
   "difficulty": "foundational",
   "estimated_minutes": 90,
   "objective": "Produce three real candidate problems, rank them against the four questions, and pick one to carry into Research.",
   "why_it_matters": "Every decision in the next nine phases inherits this one. A vague problem produces a vague product, and you will not find out for months. An hour and a half here is the cheapest work in the whole programme.",
   "objectives": [
    "Three candidates written as person, situation and cost",
